    {
      "id": "dtjtg6l",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Sources of Ancient Indian History"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Sources of Ancient Indian History provide the foundation for understanding early Indian civilization.",
        "The Prehistoric Period of India traces human activity prior to written records.",
        "The Indus Valley Civilization (Harappan Civilization) is characterized by notable town planning, economy, and religious practices.",
        "Understanding major Harappan sites and their distinct features is crucial for historical analysis.",
        "The decline of the Indus Valley Civilization marks a significant transition in ancient Indian history."
      ],
      "id": "1vtfvt6"
    },
